# Workflow for weekly reporting of Preservica ingests

This workflow details the weekly process for delivering metadata reports that can be uploaded to SPEC. For more information on the reporting workflow, please see the process [Metadata Reporting Workflow]().

## Process

1. On Monday of each week, run export_metada_only for the previous Monday to Sunday. 

    For example, on 2025-04-07, run the report with the start date of 2025-03-31 (Monday) and end date of 2025-04-06 (Sunday):
    ```sh
    poetry run export_metadata_only --credentials creds --ami_start_date 2025-03-31 --ami_end_date 2025-04-06
    ```

2. Run `--ami_retry` for any failed exports. 
+ Troubleshoot export if package fails three or more times. 

<!--(comfirm threshold for # of times to retry?)-->

3. Continue reporting workflow as documented. 

5. Submit the final compiled report for (renamed with appropriate date range) for upload to SPEC. 
    > e.g., `AMI_combined_report_2025-03-31_2025-04-06.csv`
    
6. Delete all unpacked exports, keeping the compiled report only. This will ensure records that have already been compiled do not end up in future weeks' reports. 

7. Run `reports_to_db.py` to record package IDs and workflow IDs to a local database, `recent_reports`. 




